            "review_text": "abibay\nPAsig City84 contributions\n0\nnoodle cravings solved\nSep 2017 • Friends\nthis is very near to our hotel so we tried it for dinner. We ordered their group \"shabu shabu\" collagen soup with beef strips ,veggies, mushrooms and balls. We had to cook the soup on the table so as much as we were already very hungry, we had to wait but it was worth the wait. The udon went well with the soup. They have a condiments corner where you can get chillis, chives, ginger, and toppings. The price was affordable too.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 14, 2017",
