            "review_text": "JONHallettCove J\nVietnam787 contributions\n0\nGood Clean Restaurant\nAug 2017 • Friends\nWith the wide selection of choices to make in HCMC, (IMO) the \"Marukame\" restaurant is about average for a fast food you-select ( Not like Sushi Train) eatery. The food was good without being great and a bit bland, but improved in taste with a good selection of condiments available.\nStaff were a little robotic and tried to \"gee-up\" the atmosphere with some sporadic cheering without the little dance routine you get from chains like \"hooters etc\".\nFortunately the company was good and they enjoyed the evening - so I guess so did I...but I would not hurry back.\nPS. Edditor please Note the Header Title is incorrect: It is Marukame NOT Marugame\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 8, 2017",
